; The platform. Geometry, ray casting, rendering, SDL — everything a frame is
; actually made of, and none of it anything a game should have to name.
;
; It was called camlcast until the declarative layer was ready to take that
; name. It is called core now for the reason the directory is: what a game opens
; is the layer over the top, and this is what that layer is over. A game that
; genuinely needs World or Renderer adds camlcast.core to its own dune and says
; so out loud, which is the boundary being a decision rather than a drift.

(library
 (name camlcast_core)
 (public_name camlcast.core)
 (libraries tsdl tsdl-image))
